      "reason": "The eligibility criteria implicitly convey the PICO (population: people with covid-19; interventions: blood products and covid-19-specific antibodies; comparators: each other, no intervention, placebo, or standard care; outcomes listed), but no explicit planned-comparisons statement framed in PICO form is reported; it must be inferred from eligibility criteria."
